## AI assistant quick actions, per tool
ai-qa-explain-output = Explain Output
ai-qa-explain-output-prompt = Explain what this output means: what ran, what it did, and anything that looks wrong.
ai-qa-explain-error = Explain the Error
ai-qa-explain-error-prompt = Find the error in this output, explain what causes it, and give the command that fixes it in a code block.
ai-qa-next-command = Suggest a Command
ai-qa-next-command-prompt = Suggest the next command for what I am doing here. Give one command in a code block and one line on what it does.
ai-qa-summarise = Summarise
ai-qa-summarise-prompt = Summarise this output: what ran, what succeeded, what failed, and what needs attention.
ai-qa-select-all = Select All
ai-qa-select-all-prompt = Write a SELECT of all columns from the table I am working with, limited to the first 100 rows, in this engine's dialect. Answer with one SQL code block.
ai-qa-count = Count Rows
ai-qa-count-prompt = Write a query that counts the rows of the table I am working with. Answer with one SQL code block.
ai-qa-select-ordered = Select Ordered
ai-qa-select-ordered-prompt = Write a SELECT of all columns from the table I am working with, ordered by its most useful column (a timestamp or an id) newest first, limited to 100 rows. Answer with one SQL code block.
ai-qa-explain-query = Explain Query
ai-qa-explain-query-prompt = Explain what the query in the editor does, step by step, and what it returns.
ai-qa-improve-query = Improve Query
ai-qa-improve-query-prompt = Review the query in the editor for correctness and speed. Give a faster version as one SQL code block and say which indexes it needs.
ai-qa-pre-script = Pre-request Script
ai-qa-pre-script-prompt = Write a pre-request script for this request with the pm API (a timestamp, a signature, a token refresh). Answer with an hs-api block that sets the pre-request script.
ai-qa-post-script = Post-response Script
ai-qa-post-script-prompt = Write a post-response script for this request with the pm API. Answer with an hs-api block that sets the post-response script.
ai-qa-save-vars = Save Response to Variables
ai-qa-save-vars-prompt = Write a post-response script that takes the useful values out of this response and stores them as variables with pm.environment.set, pm.collectionVariables.set or pm.globals.set. Say which scope suits each value and why. Answer with an hs-api block that sets the post-response script.
ai-qa-tests = Generate Tests
ai-qa-tests-prompt = Write pm.test assertions for this response: the status, the shape of the body and the fields that matter. Answer with an hs-api block that sets the post-response script.
ai-qa-explain-response = Explain Response
ai-qa-explain-response-prompt = Explain this response: its status, the fields that matter and anything that looks wrong.
ai-qa-docs = Write Docs
ai-qa-docs-prompt = Write Markdown documentation for this request: what it does, its parameters, its body and an example response. Answer with an hs-api block that sets the docs.
ai-qa-explain-selection = Explain Selection
ai-qa-explain-selection-prompt = Explain what is selected here: what this object or prefix holds and what it is probably for.
ai-qa-aws-cli = AWS CLI Command
ai-qa-aws-cli-prompt = Give the AWS CLI command for what I am looking at (list, copy or sync this bucket or prefix) in a code block.
ai-qa-bucket-policy = Bucket Policy
ai-qa-bucket-policy-prompt = Write a least-privilege bucket policy for the access I am using here, and explain each statement.
ai-qa-nosql-filter = Write a Filter
ai-qa-nosql-filter-prompt = Write a query filter for this container in this store's own syntax, for what I am looking for. Answer with one JSON code block and one line on what it matches.
ai-qa-nosql-explain = Explain This Query
ai-qa-nosql-explain-prompt = Explain what the filter, projection and sort on screen do, what they return, and anything in them that would scan more than it needs to.
ai-qa-nosql-index = Suggest an Index
ai-qa-nosql-index-prompt = Say which index would serve this query, give the command that creates it, and say what it costs on writes.
ai-qa-redis-explain-key = Explain This Key
ai-qa-redis-explain-key-prompt = Explain the key that is open: what its type and encoding mean, what the value looks like it is for, and whether its TTL and size look sensible.
ai-qa-redis-command = Suggest a Command
ai-qa-redis-command-prompt = Give the Redis command for what I am doing with this key, in a code block, with one line on what it does. Say so if it is destructive.
ai-qa-redis-memory = Memory and Keyspace
ai-qa-redis-memory-prompt = Looking at this key and this keyspace, say what is likely using the memory and what would reduce it: encodings, TTLs, key naming and the commands to check each.
ai-qa-image-explain = Explain This Image
ai-qa-image-explain-prompt = Describe this image and its properties, and say what it is suitable for.
ai-qa-image-edits = Suggest Edits
ai-qa-image-edits-prompt = Suggest edits for this image using this tool's operations (resize, crop, rotate, flip, adjust, grayscale, invert), in the order to apply them.
ai-qa-image-export = Best Export Format
ai-qa-image-export-prompt = Which format and settings should I export this image in, and why? Consider file size, transparency and quality.
ai-qa-image-a11y = Check Accessibility
ai-qa-image-a11y-prompt = Review this image for accessibility: contrast, legibility at icon sizes, colour-only meaning, and what alternative text would describe it.
ai-qa-diagram-layout = Review Layout
ai-qa-diagram-layout-prompt = Review the layout of this diagram: rank order, crossings, crowded ranks, edge labels and anything that reads ambiguously.
ai-qa-diagram-missing = Suggest Missing Nodes
ai-qa-diagram-missing-prompt = Suggest missing nodes or edges for this diagram, with the reason for each. Do not invent ids that already exist.
ai-qa-diagram-name = Name Diagram
ai-qa-diagram-name-prompt = Suggest a short title and a one-line subtitle for this diagram.
ai-qa-diagram-a11y = Accessibility Check
ai-qa-diagram-a11y-prompt = Review this diagram for accessibility: reading order, colour-only meaning, label clarity, and the outline a screen reader would hear.
ai-qa-gen-refine = Refine Prompt
ai-qa-gen-refine-prompt = Rewrite my prompt so a model produces the requested diagram more reliably. Keep it short and concrete.
ai-qa-gen-critique = Critique Result
ai-qa-gen-critique-prompt = Critique the generated diagram: what is missing, what is redundant, and what a reviewer would question.
ai-qa-gen-layout = Alternative Layout
ai-qa-gen-layout-prompt = Suggest an alternative layout or grouping for this diagram and why it reads better.
ai-qa-gen-explain = Explain Diagram
ai-qa-gen-explain-prompt = Explain this diagram to someone new to the system, in a short paragraph plus a numbered reading order.
